{
  "title": "Quaint Thai Sloe Berries Ssam Wrap",
  "description": "A floral and crumbly Thai dish featuring sloe berries, served in a ssam wrap, grilled to perfection on a robata grill.",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
  "diet": [
    "nut-free"
